                                                "sense_id": "dc95570a-9c94-3fdd-80ee-3846ab5fe4d1",
                                                "text": "Clay caught sight of the drake's wing outlined against the rising flames as it swept low over the desert."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59d356fb-f7e0-3438-a6ca-1b97d8872926",
                                        "entry_id": "a4efe101-6d75-3990-a730-e66fb65b71a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small piece of artillery."
