                                                "sense_id": "59d356fb-f7e0-3438-a6ca-1b97d8872926",
                                                "text": "Two or three shots, made at them by a couple of drakes, made them stagger."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "778bca70-1c4e-3a71-a7f0-dde4efca8e2e",
