                                                "sense_id": "778bca70-1c4e-3a71-a7f0-dde4efca8e2e",
                                                "text": "The moon’s my constant Mistresse\n& the lowlie owle my morrowe.\nThe flaming Drake and yͤ Nightcrowe make"
